1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,042
I had such an annoying journey this morning.

2
00:00:02,992 --> 00:00:06,994
While I was waiting to buy a ticket, someone jumped the queue.

3
00:00:06,994 --> 00:00:12,114
Then a man on the platform started playing music on his phone without headphones.

4
00:00:12,114 --> 00:00:14,906
I can't stand it when people do that.

5
00:00:14,906 --> 00:00:17,127
It really gets on my nerves.

6
00:00:17,127 --> 00:00:21,515
I wanted to say something, but I didn't want to start an argument.

7
00:00:21,515 --> 00:00:24,747
So I asked politely if he could turn it down.

8
00:00:24,747 --> 00:00:27,832
He apologised and put on his headphones.

9
00:00:27,832 --> 00:00:31,303
In the end, I arrived at the museum on time.

